==Battleground==
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zory]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**5 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

